    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_01",
      "hash64": "BAE39ABD743CDFC2",
      "text": "Mann, wie oft denn noch, Dad?! Ich bin mit\\nFreunden unterwegs, nicht allein![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_02",
      "hash64": "BAE399BD743CDE0F",
      "text": "Ja, ja... Du musst dir keine Sorgen um uns\\nmachen. WIR SIND ALT GENUG![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_03",
      "hash64": "BAE398BD743CDC5C",
      "text": "Komm mir nicht mit deinem „Tahaha“! Ich kann’s\\nnicht leiden, wenn du so am Helikoptern bist,\\r\\ndas weißt du![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_04",
      "hash64": "BAE397BD743CDAA9",
      "text": "Boah, wieso muss der immer so anstrengend\\nsein?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_friend_02",
      "hash64": "3A1086D73EFC2451",
      "text": "Hast du sein Okay gekriegt?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_05",
      "hash64": "BAE396BD743CD8F6",
      "text": "Ja, aber nur, nachdem ich lang genug seinem\\nnervigen Gefasel zugehört hab...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_friend_03",
      "hash64": "3A1085D73EFC229E",
      "text": "Haha, davon solltest du so viel absorbieren,\\nwie du nur kannst![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_botan_06",
      "hash64": "BAE395BD743CD743",
      "text": "Äh, ja... Vielleicht hast du recht...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_rival_03",
      "hash64": "FDAF2C3F1233774A",
      "text": "Gut, damit hätten wir auch die letzte Erlaubnis\\neingetütet und wir sind vollzählig.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0030_rival_04",
      "hash64": "FDAF273F12336ECB",
      "text": "Checkt noch mal, ob ihr auch nichts vergessen\\nhabt. Wenn nicht, kann die Reise losgehen![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
